WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.667
Supervisor (Australian female): Good morning, Northwood Wildlife Park.

00:00:03.127 --> 00:00:06.037
Applicant (British male): Hello. I'm calling about the volunteer programme.

00:00:06.517 --> 00:00:07.982
Supervisor (Australian female): May I have your surname?

00:00:08.322 --> 00:00:15.492
Applicant (British male): Morgan. M, O, R, G, A, N.

00:00:15.912 --> 00:00:17.078
Supervisor (Australian female): When can you start?

00:00:17.418 --> 00:00:22.687
Applicant (British male): The twenty-second of March. I had planned the twentieth, but I have an exam that day.

00:00:23.167 --> 00:00:24.797
Supervisor (Australian female): Which area would you prefer?

00:00:25.137 --> 00:00:27.703
Applicant (British male): The visitor centre, rather than the cafe.

00:00:28.183 --> 00:00:30.236
Supervisor (Australian female): Do you have any relevant training?

00:00:30.576 --> 00:00:32.854
Applicant (British male): Yes, a first-aid certificate.

00:00:33.334 --> 00:00:43.365
Supervisor (Australian female): Volunteers receive free lunch and a bus pass for each working day. A uniform is provided after the trial month. Accommodation and bicycle hire aren't available.

00:00:43.945 --> 00:00:46.005
Applicant (British male): How should I send my photograph?

00:00:46.345 --> 00:00:52.353
Supervisor (Australian female): Upload it through the online form. Please ask your two referees to email their references directly.

00:00:52.833 --> 00:00:54.739
Applicant (British male): What is the earliest morning shift?

00:00:55.079 --> 00:01:01.144
Supervisor (Australian female): It begins at seven thirty. Staff meet at seven, but volunteers arrive half an hour later.

00:01:01.624 --> 00:01:08.384
Applicant (British male): Great. I'm especially interested in the bird survey because I want practical field experience before university.

00:01:08.864 --> 00:01:10.728
Supervisor (Australian female): I'll send the details today.
